# Scripts run on the Linux runner and in WSL. A Windows checkout that converts
# them to CRLF breaks them: `set -euo pipefail` becomes `set -euo pipefail\r` and
# bash rejects it at line 2. Keep these LF everywhere; docs can stay native.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
